Z||000000||1FST2M6||06-08-2001||08:13 AM||||D@MN that was easy and OH HELL yeah it made a difference. i left my digital camera at home so i couldn't take any during pics.. but i'll get pics with the wheels off this weekend... the ONLY problem i had was snapping a stud off as i put my last wheel on... <P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstcaliper1.jpg">   <P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstcaliper2.jpg">    <P><BR>the braided lines were a snap to replace.. the entire thing rear brakes and all 4 lines took about an hour and 45 min... start to driving out after 10min of being Pissed i broke a stud...(i'll fix that tomorrow at the shop)<P>I would deffinatly recommend this mod.<P><BR>.. NITROUS install will be completed tomorrow..    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> hehhehe <P>------------------<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig1fst.jpg">           <A HREF="http://www.engineered.net" TARGET=_blank>www.engineered.net</A>  <A HREF="http://www.enthuza.com" TARGET=_blank>www.enthuza.com</A> <BR> <BR> <p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 06-08-2001).]||||reg||1
