Z||000005||1FST2M6||06-08-2001||11:10 PM||||yep..its wet..  it's installed i've got pics and inSANELY detiled instructions from NX. I got an NOS kit from the shop tuner and a friend that works there.. but they just picked up Nitrous Express and are a stocking dealer.. they returned the dry kit and get the wet one for me... =)  it was cheaper for them and WAY better for me. any who..  i'll post all the pics with the dyno results before and after headers. <P>the whole reason i don't have the kit working.. they told me i HAD to have decent brakes on this car before they gave me the bottle .. so i've got the kit installed and the bottle brackets.. but no bottle.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> that'll all change soon..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  i'll be sure to hook up with RodrV6 on thursday for dinner and take him for a slide around the block...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> nothin says loving like smokin the tires till you let off the gas..  <A HREF="http://www.nitrousexpress.com" TARGET=_blank>www.nitrousexpress.com</A>  or <A HREF="http://www.engineered.net" TARGET=_blank>www.engineered.net</A>  for nitrous info... or just ask me and i'll answer any of your questions.. the nitrous install took about 3.5 hours. bout the same as my old dry kit did||||reg||1
